module test.claim.roadmap.roadmap_submission_witness_test

// SLICE 2, docs/plans/harness-work-lifecycle.md rule 7: the handoff lifecycle at the real
// execution boundary, on planted inputs. Each claim names the state it refutes: a terminal worker
// read as ready, a passed candidate waiting on a discretionary ask, a disabled helper read as
// discharged, a resumed publication duplicating its PR, a later edit wearing a prior head's
// evidence, a fanin that loses a side or mints over a conflict.

